{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"2025年步态启动阶段STN-LFP与后续FOG事件研究（报告引用预印本，最终同行评审版本）\",\n      \"pmid\": \"40709562\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1101/2025.01.10.632393\",\n      \"report_says\": \"第201行及第338行称：“这些分析主要来自没有实际冻结发生的步态启动试次。”\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"最终同行评审论文纳入38名患者，其中12名观察到实际FOG，共记录263次冻结事件，冻结通常发生在步态启动后约8步。虽然LFP分析窗口位于冻结发生之前的步态启动阶段，但不能据此将整项研究描述为没有实际冻结事件的试次。报告混淆了神经信号分析窗口位于冻结之前与研究试次中没有实际冻结事件这两个不同概念。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Klocke等，2024年，STN-LFP、拮抗肌EMG及步态运动学同步记录与冻结期间STN-肌肉耦合研究\",\n      \"pmid\": \"39470410\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"结构化附录S2_E_PMID_39470410_1将样本量标记为“摘要未报告”，并将证据基础标记为“abstract”。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原始论文全文明确报告最终分析队列为12名患者，并提供实际冻结事件、肌肉共同激活以及STN-肌肉耦合的详细分析。因此，将样本量记录为摘要未报告是不准确的，且仅以摘要作为证据基础遗漏了全文中已经报告的关键原始数据。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4314544d-38ac-4867-a919-bfb439879ace", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T104344824067Z", "elapsed_seconds": 29.109, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T10:44:13.939850+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b9149f1bd1c1aaecb9144ca25e93f0f57bacabb767074c0c9b06ebff1839fee2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T104344824067Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c73073a06c8c46c311a703008bc9648051269bf350d9a5a59bc7124963db0fe8"}}}
